 | Constants | Typed integer literals and `true` / `false` boolean literals |
 | Integer operations | `int.add.wrap`, `int.sub.wrap`, `int.mul.wrap`, `bit.and`, `bit.or`, `bit.xor`, checked left/right shifts |
